{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463470/extras/ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1741808365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hidden Tomatoes: Farm Frenzy</i> takes you to a lively farm where your mission is to find 100 hidden tomatoes scattered across vibrant fields, barns, and cozy farmhouses. Explore the beautiful rural environment as you uncover hidden tomatoes cleverly tucked away in every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With calming background music and a soothing countryside atmosphere, this game offers a relaxing yet exciting experience for all players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf45 1 Level, 100 hidden tomatoes in a picturesque farm setting.<br>\ud83d\udc49 Click on the tomatoes as you find them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through lush fields, old barns, and quaint farmhouses in search of hidden treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No time limits\u2014take your time to enjoy the peaceful farm life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun and challenging for players of all ages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you discover all the hidden tomatoes on the farm? Start your adventure now!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chainsaw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463470/691e2fec998efeed3e476aaa7db1b297d2c67bc8.jpg"},{"name":"Gas Can","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463470/d424b07ac088d0d864e1eb535ad675277bf93fcd.jpg"},{"name":"Axe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463470/c458c963066f8e14b611caf3cf527723d9013a62.jpg"},{"name":"EggPlant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463470/6fed00b0cc152e4664545e81e632cf790b895154.jpg"},{"name":"W